I also want to give a quick
shout out to Wilfred Chan,

00:19:45.132 --> 00:19:47.394
Wilfred thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:19:47.394 --> 00:19:48.550
Your One Word.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:51.002
It really, really, really,
really means a lot to me.

00:19:51.002 --> 00:19:54.340
So thank you guys again for
watching I believe in you.

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.606
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself.

00:19:56.606 --> 00:19:59.106
And whatever your one word is,

00:20:01.239 --> 00:20:03.572
much love I'll see you soon.

